// TURBOJET EXHAUST — spawned by scripts/vehicle_fx.lua on a turbojet part
// (parented to it, at the nozzle, turned so local +Y points out of it). Each
// child is one effect so each can be driven (and left off on Low) on its own:
// the plume and its light by the spool, the shimmer, the soot, the contrail.
// Effects: tools/gen_vfx_vehicle.py.
